document.write('<li class="rss-item"><a class="rss-item" href="http://www.gadgetreview.com/2011/01/who-won-the-audioengine-n22-amp-and-p4-speakers-worth-450.html" target="_blank">Who Won The AudioEngine N22 Amp And P4 Speakers Worth $450? Click To Find Out</a><br />');
document.write('<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-79137 aligncenter\" title=\"Audio engine N22\" src=\"http://www.gadgetreview.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/01/Audio-engine-N22.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"323\" /></p> <p>We&#8217;ve got a winner for the <a href=\"http://www.gadgetreview.com/2011/01/win-an-audioengine-n22-amp-and-p4-speakers-450-value-from-gadgetreview.html\"title=\"Audioengine Contest\" target=\"_blank\">Audioengine N22 Amp and P4 Speaker giveaway</a>!  It&#8217;s&#8230;drumroll&#8230;LeAndrew W. Taylor!  Congrats to LeAndrew and thank you to everyone else who is following us on our <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/pages/GadgetReview/34842276902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"GadgetReview Facebook Fan Page\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook fan page</a> and entered to win.</p> <p>Make sure you checkout our other contest from <a href=\"http://www.gadgetreview.com/2011/01/win-a-grace-digital-wifi-bookshelf-system-250-value-from-gadgetreview.html\"title=\"Gracedigital Contest\" >GraceDigital</a>, which is ending tomorrow.  You could win a $250 stereo system with built-in WiFi.. We&#8217;re also giving away 5 copies of <a href=\"http://www.gadgetreview.com/2011/01/win-a-free-copy-of-dead-space-for-the-iphone-from-gadgetreview.html\"title=\"Dead Space iPhone Contest\" >Dead Space for the iPhone</a>. And if you didn&#8217;t know, you can subscribe to our <a href=\"http://www.gadgetreview.com/categories/contests/feed\"title=\"Contest Feed\" target=\"_blank\">Contest Feed</a> and get all the latests contests, and contests only, directly in your reader.</p> <p>Lastly, if you&#8217;re intereseted in buying some <a href=\"http://audioengineusa.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Audioengine Gear\" target=\"_blank\">Audioengine</a> gear, they&#8217;re offering GadgetReview readers an exclusive 10% off on all purchases using coupon code: <strong>GRTEN%</strong>.</p> <p>Again, thanks for entering and look out for our next contest!</p>');
