document.write('<li class="rss-item"><a class="rss-item" href="http://www.gadgetreview.com/2011/01/sonys-ngp-handheld-heavy-on-the-tech.html" target="_blank">Sony’s NGP (PSP3) Handheld Heavy On The Tech</a><br />');
document.write('<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-79140\" title=\"Sony PSP3 NGP.04 AM\" src=\"http://www.gadgetreview.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/01/Sony-PSP3-NGP.04-AM.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"635\" height=\"413\" /></p> <p>Wow, the NGP is to the PSP what Tarzan is to Jane, speaking in strict terms of horsepower, and without all the hidden jungle sex. With multiple touchpads, four times the resolution and dual analog sticks, you&#8217;d expect it to race past any other handheld, and it will – considering its quad-core Cortex-A9 processor and, on top of that, a quad-core Imagination Technologies PowerVR SGX543MP4+ GPU.</p> <p>Saying quad-core twice in the same sentence? Didn&#8217;t think I&#8217;d have to do that until next year at the very least. <a href=\"http://www.gadgetreview.com/2011/01/sonys-ngp-handheld-heavy-on-the-tech.html#more-79096\" class=\"more-link\">(more&#8230;)</a></p>');
